        "id": 5631
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-02T15:17:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I assume the `std::min` is still going to resolve to a compare and ternary, though?  So we end up with the same basic logic (with the slight difference that if we somehow have a non-zero color channel accompanied by a zero alpha, we\u0027ll end up unpremuling to 255, rather than 0)?",
      "parentUuid": "a28dabdb_44704ba1",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 54,
        "startChar": 23,
        "endLine": 54,
        "endChar": 46
      },
      "revId": "04f9ba6904679e175e89c135d5fb360905d4b3df",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0a482cfc_6f5538af",
        "filename": "src/opts/SkSwizzler_opts.h",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 54,
      "author": {
        "id": 11059
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-02T15:24:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, that\u0027s not right; std::min is branchless (`minss`), but the ternary actually makes a branch.\n\nhttps://godbolt.org/z/bzWEsjo55",
      "parentUuid": "50b92c8a_66df1728",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 54,
        "startChar": 23,
        "endLine": 54,
        "endChar": 46
      },
      "revId": "04f9ba6904679e175e89c135d5fb360905d4b3df",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "02856d87_47c28524",
        "filename": "src/opts/SkSwizzler_opts.h",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 54,
      "author": {
        "id": 11059
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-02T15:26:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Also: the godbolt output is actually emitting function calls to `roundf` which concerns me (from a performance standpoint).",
      "parentUuid": "0a482cfc_6f5538af",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 54,
        "startChar": 23,
        "endLine": 54,
        "endChar": 46
      },
      "revId": "04f9ba6904679e175e89c135d5fb360905d4b3df",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0606ebb7_96b4e8f0",
        "filename": "src/opts/SkSwizzler_opts.h",
